    en: "There is a concert by the writer's favourite singer this weekend; the ticket was bought two months ago, and “공연을 빨리 보고 싶습니다” (I can't wait to see it). The writer is looking forward to it — ③. ① The ticket is already bought, ② there's no wish to be a singer, and ④ the concert hasn't happened yet.",
