    en: "The writer exercises alone in the morning, but “아침에 ( ㉠ ) 일어나는 것이 힘들어서 가끔 운동을 못 합니다” (it's hard to get up ( ) so sometimes I can't). To exercise in the morning you must get up early, and that's the hard part: ④ 일찍. Getting up late (③) isn't hard, and ① and ② don't fit. -는 것 turns a verb into a noun.",
