    en: "“지폐는 쉽게 찢어지고 더러워져서…” — banknotes get dirty easily: ①. ② In the past only coins were used. ③ It's the opposite: notes came after coins (“지폐를 늦게 사용한 것”). ④ It is paper money that is easy to fake.",
