    en: "“걸으려고 꼭 밖으로 ( ㉡ ). 집 안도 좋고 사무실 안도 괜찮습니다” — walking inside the house or office is fine, so you don't have to go out: ③ 나가지 않아도 됩니다. 꼭 … -지 않아도 되다 means “you don't necessarily have to”. ① and ② clash with the next sentence, and ④ “decide not to go out” is too strong.",
